      <div type="clause" n="9.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 9.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se þe þæt nelle, [þæt his hade gebyrige], wanige his wurðscipe ge for Gode ge for worlde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And he who will not do [what befits his order] shall impair both his ecclesiastical and his civil status.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se þe þæt nelle þæt his hade gebyrige: wanige his weorðscype ge for Gode ge for worolde.</ab>
      </div>
